<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS. [CORRECTED 23:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS. [CORRECTED 23:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague</p>
<p>basketball matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Moscow: CSKA Moscow (Russia) 67 Alba Berlin (Germany) 69</p>
<p>(halftime 34-39)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Berlin - Windel Alexis 17</p>
<p>CSKA - Valery Dayneko 21</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,800</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Tel Aviv: Maccabi Tel Aviv (Israel) 87 Charleroi</p>
<p>(Belgium) 70 (halftime 51-34).</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Maccabi - Buck Johnson 24, Randy White 20</p>
<p>Charleroi - Jacques Stas 16, Ron Ellis 12</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>In Madrid: Estudiantes (Spain) 97 Ulker Spor (Turkey) 63 (48-29)  </p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Milan: Stefanel Milan (Italy) 73 Olympiakos (Greece) 71 (Corrects Stefanel Milan-Olympiakos full-time score from 63-61)</p>
<p>(HT 39-38)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Milan - Warren Kidd 20 Alessandro de Pol 12</p>
<p>Olympiakos - Panayiotis Fassoulas 15, David Rivers 15 Giorgos Sigalas 13</p>
<p>Group G</p>
<p>In Villeurbanne:</p>
<p>Villeurbanne (France) 82 Dynamo Moscow (Russia) 52.</p>
<p>Leading scorers</p>
<p>Villeurbanne - Brian Howard 16, Georgie Adams 15, Jimmy Nebot 13</p>
<p>Moscow - Maxim Astanin 15, Pavel Astakov 13, Oleg Meleschenko 10</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
<p>Group H (played Wednesday)</p>
<p>In Bologna: Kinder Bologna (Italy 90) Bayer Leverkusen (Germany) 100 (41-53)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Kinder - Zoran Savic 25</p>
<p>Bayer - Tony Dawson 43</p>
<p>Attendance - 5,520</p>
